{
  "description": "dsh-today-token-usage 依赖的上游事实：会话面板分区槽与通用行样式；`llm/stream` 拦截点与其中的 `usage` 块（每一次模型调用的用量来源）；宿主 `webServer` 路由注册面、`webserver/authorize` 鉴权决策、浏览器 cookie 鉴权提供方，以及 web server 对 `text/event-stream` 的免压缩处理（同源 SSE 推送能否被页面即时收到）；还有「用量」按钮的读数口径（总用量算式、`number.thousand` / `number.million` 单位、缓存命中百分比）。check-css.mjs 逐条验证这些事实仍存在于上游构建产物中：槽或行标记改名时整栏静默消失或变成没有样式的裸行；`llm/stream` 或 `usage` 块改名时一次模型调用也记不到；路由、鉴权或 SSE 免压缩处理改名时页面拿不到推送；读数口径改名时面板数字与输入框下方的「用量」按钮分叉（数值口径对齐，单位按本栏自己的「无单位 / K / M」显示）。",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "session-panel-section-slot",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "conversation.session.panel.section",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-session-panel/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "会话面板不再声明 conversation.session.panel.section 槽：注册进去也不显示，「今日 Token 用量」整栏静默消失"
    },
    {
      "id": "session-panel-section-render",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "pattern": "renderSlot\\(\\s*[\"'`]conversation\\.session\\.panel\\.section[\"'`]",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-session-panel/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "面板不再渲染分区槽出口：即使槽键还在，这一栏也永远不会被渲染"
    },
    {
      "id": "session-panel-row",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "data-session-panel-row",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-session-panel/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "面板行的通用容器标记改名：本插件那一行没有面板行的高度、内边距与字体，变成裸文本"
    },
    {
      "id": "session-panel-row-part-trailing",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "pattern": "data-row-part=trailing",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-session-panel/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "面板行的 trailing 位改名：读数不再排在右侧、也不再使用次级色"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-stream-waterfall",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "llm/stream",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-llm/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "llm/stream waterfall 改名或消失：宿主半部拦截不到任何模型调用，journal 与面板始终为空"
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-usage-chunk",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "pattern": "type: 'usage'",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-llm/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "chunk 词汇里的 usage 块改名：每次调用都记不到用量，journal 不落行、面板永远为空"
    },
    {
      "id": "webserver-route-register",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "register(route",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-host-webserver/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "ctx.webServer.register(route) 的签名改名：宿主统计路由注册不上，浏览器半部拿不到当天合计"
    },
    {
      "id": "webserver-authorize-event",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "webserver/authorize",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-host-webserver/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "webserver/authorize 决策点改名：路由的 auth: 'required' 不再按预期校验，可能一律 401/503 或未鉴权"
    },
    {
      "id": "webserver-sse-uncompressed",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "text/event-stream",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-host-webserver/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "web server 不再把 text/event-stream 排除在 gzip 之外：SSE 帧可能被压缩缓冲，页面收不到即时推送"
    },
    {
      "id": "connection-authorize-listener",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "webserver/authorize",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-connection/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "连接层不再监听 webserver/authorize：浏览器带 cookie 的同源请求不会被识别为 owner，统计路由返回 403/401"
    },
    {
      "id": "cookie-authentication-provider",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "authentication.register",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-host-authentication-token/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "浏览器会话 cookie 的鉴权提供方注册面改名：页面里的同源 fetch 拿不到 owner Peer，面板没有数据"
    },
    {
      "id": "usage-total-formula",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "pattern": "billedInputTokens\\([a-zA-Z_]+\\)\\+[a-zA-Z_$]+\\.outputTokens",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "「用量」按钮的总量算式变了（不再等于输入三桶 + 输出）：面板读数与它不再同一个数"
    },
    {
      "id": "usage-cache-hit-format",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "formatCacheHitPercent",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "缓存命中百分比算法改名：本插件照抄的那份会与按钮读数分叉（尤其是部分命中不许舍入成 100 的规则）"
    },
    {
      "id": "usage-pill-entry",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "pattern": "id:`usage`",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "输入框下方的「用量」条目 id 改名：口径的对照物不在了，文档与读数对齐的对象需要重新确认"
    },
    {
      "id": "number-thousand-unit",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "number.thousand",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-locale/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "common 字典的 number.thousand 消失：千级读数会退化成裸键名"
    },
    {
      "id": "number-million-unit",
      "plugin": "dsh-today-token-usage",
      "token": "number.million",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-locale/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "common 字典的 number.million 消失：百万级读数会退化成裸键名"
    }
  ]
}
